# The Blizzard-owned UI art (Assets/wotlk-*) used to be excluded here on a
# "never redistributed" rule. That rule stopped matching reality once the
# installer, which embeds the same art, started being published as a release
# asset on this public repo: the art was being redistributed either way, and
# excluding the sources only meant CI could not build the real product.
# The art is tracked now. See Assets/README.md.
/Launcher.exe
/wow-launcher.PNG

# Local design scratch, not part of the shipped app.
/_mockup-preview.html

# Build output
/bin/
/obj/
/x64/
/Generated Files/
/dist/
/packages/

# MSBuild resolves the IntDir for direct `msbuild azerothcore.vcxproj` builds
# (no .sln in play) to a nested /azerothcore/x64/... rather than the top-level
# /x64/ this file already ignores, and MIDLRT drops its generated *_h.h
# headers in the working directory instead of Generated Files/. Both are pure
# build byproducts, regenerated on every build.
/azerothcore/
*_h.h

# Loose object files and test executables from ad-hoc compilation
*.obj
*_test.exe
*Tests.exe

# Internal task-execution progress tracking, not part of the shipped app.
.superpowers/
